
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: |
  This repository provides R/Stan scripts to model longitudinal SARS-CoV-2 antibody kinetics (e.g., anti-Spike binding antibody and neutralizing titers) and to translate antibody levels into predicted protection against symptomatic infection.

  If you use this software, please cite the associated published article:
  Numakura K, Miyamoto S, Sataka A, Takeyama H, Suzuki T.
  Long-term antibody waning and antibody-associated protection across diverse SARS-CoV-2 immune histories.
  Communications Health 1, 24 (2026).
  https://doi.org/10.1038/s44528-026-00021-6

type: software
title: "R and Stan codes for SARS-CoV-2 antibody kinetics modeling"

abstract: >-
  R/Stan scripts for SARS-CoV-2 antibody kinetics modeling and estimation of
  antibody-associated protection against symptomatic infection.
  Associated publication: Numakura K, Miyamoto S, Sataka A, Takeyama H, Suzuki T.
  Long-term antibody waning and antibody-associated protection across diverse
  SARS-CoV-2 immune histories. Communications Health 1, 24 (2026).
  https://doi.org/10.1038/s44528-026-00021-6

